Title: Express the number of spanning trees in term of degrees
Authors: Fengming Dong, Jun Ge, Zhangdong Ouyang
Date: Tue Jun 15 04:12:33 2021

It is well-known that the number of spanning trees, denoted by $\tau(G)$, in a connected multi-graph $G$ can be calculated by the Matrix-Tree theorem and Tutte's deletion-contraction theorem. In this short note, we find an alternate method to compute $\tau(G)$ by degrees of vertices.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
